MODIFICATIONS
-------------

This is a port to Go of wild-wild-path 3.6.0. It is not a translation of the
upstream source: it is an independent implementation written against the
upstream library's documented behaviour and verified by differential testing
against it.

Scope differs deliberately. Truto uses a subset of wild-wild-path — get, list,
set and remove, with the wildcard, union, slice and regex path syntax — and only
that subset is implemented. Query serialisation, the class-based API and the
options this codebase does not exercise are absent.

Behavioural differences from upstream, where any are found, are recorded in
DIVERGENCES.md rather than silently corrected.
